<span class="p">}</span></code></pre></figure> </div> </div> </div> </li></ol> </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="template"/><category term="formatting"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A template demonstrating al-folio blog post features.]]></summary></entry></feed>